The 'pages' folder contains the main UI components that structure the game client's user interface, with MainContainer.tsx serving as the primary layout orchestrator and client-status-page.tsx providing real-time server health monitoring. These components work together to create the visual framework and operational oversight of the game client. The folder represents the frontend presentation layer that users interact with directly.

MainContainer derives the app-wide connectionId through connectionIdForHost (features/connection/connectionId.ts): `dsl-mud` while disconnected AND for the DSL game, `host:port` for a custom server. Every per-connection store (scripts, globals, variables, auto-leveling, library, equipment, plugin CSS) is keyed by it, so changing that rule orphans stored data unless features/connection/connectionIdMigration.ts gets a matching rule.
